{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgrP1aeABaAD5A4hPsCfj","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01LvqfG2HzhKuLYKBRpLXRHt","name":"StructuredOutput","input":{"candidates":[{"file":"src/users/users.service.ts","symbol":"UsersService.update","start_line":172,"end_line":283,"explanation":"The profile edit goes through UsersService.update with a partial payload that has no `photo`. The photo branch most likely resets the photo (to null/undefined) when `photo` is absent. It should only touch the photo when the payload actually contains one. As a result, a name-only edit overwrites the stored photo and the avatar vanishes. This is unverified because the code wasn't visible."},{"file":"src/auth/auth.service.ts","symbol":"AuthService.update","start_line":426,"end_line":520,"explanation":"The profile page uses PATCH /auth/me, which calls AuthService.update. It may build or normalise the payload so that `photo` is explicitly null or undefined when the client doesn't send one. It then passes that to usersService.update, which overwrites the stored photo."},{"file":"src/users/infrastructure/persistence/relational/repositories/user.repository.ts","symbol":"UsersRelationalRepository.update","start_line":102,"end_line":121,"explanation":"The update merges the existing domain entity with the payload and passes the result through UserMapper.toPersistence. If the payload carries an explicit `photo: undefined/null` key, or the mapper drops the photo when it is absent, the save writes a null photo. Merging should skip undefined fields so the existing photo is kept."}],"fix":{"file":"src/users/users.service.ts","description":"In UsersService.update, only touch `photo` when the payload actually includes it. Resolve the file via filesService.findById only if `clonedPayload.photo?.id` is set. Otherwise delete the `photo` key from the payload (or leave it undefined) so the repository update doesn't overwrite the existing photo. Also make AuthService.update and the repository merge skip undefined or null photo values."}},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":11967,"cache_read_input_tokens":791,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":11967},"output_tokens":6,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"b808d362-1748-4f75-aaf1-66ca891d158b","uuid":"1a99dcfd-b1ba-4dbe-a073-dd9e68502f7d","timestamp":"2026-11-09T00:07:49.018Z","request_id":"req_011CgrP1aKJnLZANppffeXHe"}
